", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210884_988670664993027_3401519494358859447_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wXqnWcX_ovkQ7kNvwGM5KTt&_nc_oc=AdqqSwyb1YtmQuBw9LXn6BWos-BXIlSMJ_D0kmvyx4gPE-YOkk8qOmUX4QWW6E8OlN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ464JribPgWRllfQVbmtqNK-8yN7zhr3ydxCLcu0kr0Q&oe=6AFC8807"}, {"file_name": "delete me 1 .png", "id": "172355680988904", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_172355684322237_4105130526410975147_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i_UjcXFO_5IQ7kNvwHCCQ1V&_nc_oc=AdrsIcKAQp7lulWsl8K4QmPWGiM7v70WOLJL6BDTVfMbm58tJsdNtiGcQky3VSbWgZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTGJ-5iIPzb9YYPEGGfEajxTnzCgywcRoggU3bHV2L3vg&oe=6AFC6F19"}, {"file_name": "delete me 4.png", "id": "158877452514842", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422392_158877455848175_4048704126648886678_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mg3RV7YN6DEQ7kNvwEY2mRp&_nc_oc=AdpTF5EpQ3Bq3ZG5k7zQ2MGonmXa3jRj7anQa70hI4TFWy0XDMazgNdK61V18P1mZVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8k5wry6BT-oTqORixjmkxoUAaHuoKb37ZI-qQVA6D0A&oe=6AFC748B"}, {"file_name": "delete me.png", "id": "138116401478547", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462963_138116404811880_7726014392190288933_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITOvY4U9REMQ7kNvwG8zPff&_nc_oc=AdrmbLTg47aC-pzOwZYvEotXqlu03I_mR-qz8_--mmQ4CrQHGAUfhJkEUdLC3_Im40I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnzeUR2rWPAuYcW42sppm0Xtmyax9RvV-gWri9pMA25w&oe=6AFC7A9E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "delette me 6.png", "id": "462900904730118", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570311_462900908063451_1017078218521890310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xXOnq8WZ4goQ7kNvwGlxPn_&_nc_oc=AdrKz_qDeAg_Ftx1oS3QFnHucx9mREpzArqYONFpq8RiRoSIUvxsU6tFN5Q1PerCdMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwP9vWAvfIDvPEWPSm36aV5BHB6OrJCDXDP8OghxEfPw&oe=6AFC8A65"}, "display_name": "Healium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination. Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Use your feelings of focused calm to make the flurries fly inside a magic snow globe. Sit quietly inside a zen garden. Grow leaves on a 150-year-old Burr Oak tree with your memories of being still. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. In four peer-reviewed journals, Healium has been shown to improve mood in as little as four minutes. Connect an optional EEG meditation headband to make a firefly rise and fall with your feelings. Healium is a reminder that our thoughts have power to control things not only in the virtual world but the real world as well.", "short_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination.  Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. "}]}, "developer_name": "Healium", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tryhealium.com/privacy-policy/", "devel